@startuml
title HANDOFF-DEMO - Scan and adjust stock

|Workshop user|
start
:Open the part lookup page;
:Scan the code on the part label;
|System|
if (Code matches a part?) then (yes)
  :Show the part and its on-hand count;
else (no)
  :Show "part not found" and offer manual entry;
  stop
endif
|Workshop user|
:Choose consume or receive;
:Enter a whole number of pieces;
|System|
if (Would the result go below zero?) then (yes)
  :Reject and keep the previous count;
  stop
else (no)
  :Apply the movement and record who and when;
endif
:Show the updated on-hand count;
stop
@enduml
